.TH pe_get_section 3
.SH NAME
pe_get_section \- find section by name
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "pe.h"
.PP
.BI "pe_section_header *pe_get_section(void *" base ", const char *" name ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pe_get_section
searches for a section with the given
.I name
in the PE file header. Returns a pointer to the section header, or NULL if not found.